d-gta-6s-blockbuster-launch">PocketGamer.biz</source></item><item><title>三个新工具：Steam 审核队列、商店页检查器与商店页制作指南</title><link>https://howtomarketagame.com/2026/11/19/3-new-steam-tools</link><description>Steam 审核排队现在要等约一个月，文章介绍了排队现状、商店页检查工具与做商店页的方法，上线前值得先看一眼。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 14:09:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">cd86faed044c6ce9dfcb7a19128b7761af5f92a1</guid><source url="https://howtomarketagame.com/2026/11/19/3-new-steam-tools">How to Market a Game</source></item><item><title>Blender Agent Kit v0.2.2：让 AI 智能体拥有可用于生产的 3D 资产管线</title><link>https://dev.to/tosumitdhaka/blender-agent-kit-v022-giving-ai-agents-a-production-ready-3d-asset-pipeline-2bh4</link><description>这款开源 Blender 工具包让 AI 智能体从零生成可直接进游戏引擎的 3D 资产，实测中它抓出了真实的生产缺陷并大幅节省了管线搭建的工作量。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 15:03:12 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">4ef4826425b4d1015da1896df30396d53c6c1363</guid><source url="https://dev.to/tosumitdhaka/blender-agent-kit-v022-giving-ai-agents-a-production-ready-3d-asset-pipeline-2bh4">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>让角色变形更自然的聪明权重绘制工具</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/clever-weight-painting-tool-for-better-character-deformations</link><description>这款权重绘制工具能让角色蒙皮变形更顺滑，做绑定与角色美术的开发者值得一看。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:21:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">5301c9d9d112462e375e13bb45326ef79cd7b608</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/clever-weight-painting-tool-for-better-character-deformations">80 Level</source></item><item><title>这款蜘蛛侠模拟器唤起了粘性爬墙玩具的回忆</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/this-spider-man-simulation-brings-back-memories-of-sticky-wall-crawler-toys</link><description>开发者 Duncan Tune 用物理模拟复刻了童年粘性爬墙玩具的手感，顺带分享了他的制作流程。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 18:25:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">2b96ca2faed3b042685f9f131e479dfcfaf511aa</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/this-spider-man-simulation-brings-back-memories-of-sticky-wall-crawler-toys">80 Level</source></item><item><title>报道：GTA 6 发售首日销售额近 20 亿美元</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/report-gta-6-generated-nearly-usd2b-in-sales-by-launch-day</link><description>报道称 GTA 6 发售首日卖出约 1900 万份、收入 18.4 亿美元，或成史上规模最大的娱乐产品首发之一。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 20:48:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">adf5c14bc19c5fc4304f935767ed682617a89577</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/report-gta-6-generated-nearly-usd2b-in-sales-by-launch-day">80 Level</source></item><item><title>我用纯 JavaScript 写了一个完整的竞技场射击游戏——不用引擎、不用库、不用音频文件</title><link>https://dev.to/kamalmosadegh/i-built-a-complete-arena-shooter-in-vanilla-javascript-no-engine-no-libraries-no-audio-files-46m0</link><description>开发者用原生 JavaScript 与 Canvas 2D 写完了竞技场射击游戏 VOIDSTORM，音乐、激光与 Boss 吼叫全部由 Web Audio API 实时合成，仓库里没有任何音频文件，打开 index.html 就能玩。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 20:38:45 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">1109bf3ddebc5ca53c5f083b519d4ad66b1e3833</guid><source url="https://dev.to/kamalmosadegh/i-built-a-complete-arena-shooter-in-vanilla-javascript-no-engine-no-libraries-no-audio-files-46m0">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>不写代码也能做手游，还要做得手感好</title><link>https://dev.to/tyrboai/how-to-make-a-mobile-game-without-coding-and-make-it-feel-good-2cfd</link><description>向 AI 游戏引擎描述想法就能做出真正能玩的手游，难的从来不是代码，而是设计本身。</description><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 23:22:03 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f7c757cd8e97db2fc81d1e187ec9b48ee31d8bd6</guid><source url="https://dev.to/tyrboai/how-to-make-a-mobile-game-without-coding-and-make-it-feel-good-2cfd">Dev.to 游戏开发</source></item><item><title>网易Q3游戏收入223亿元，管理层：短剧爆发对游戏业有影响，AI助力游戏玩法多元化</title><link>http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/606884</link><description>网易三季度游戏收入 223 亿元，管理层在财报会上谈到短剧热潮对游戏行业的冲击，以及 AI 如何让玩法变得更多元。</description><pubDate>Fri, 20 Nov 2026 03:18:17 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">f31f035b30103113d0d83453cfcc66138c7f79ee</guid><source url="http://www.gamelook.com.cn/2026/11/606884">GameLook</source></item></channel></rss>
